      "raw": "[quote=\"monogarden\"]\n\nI tend to not pay any attention to the card backs since I only play digitally and it never occurred to me that you'd be able to see what deck it was from.\n\n[/quote]\n\nAlso relevant in digital when you're in the Temple of Zhu Long, except there it's the cards atop your hero decks that you might want to be aware of.\n\nEspecially if you've done something that shuffled a Shinobi Assassin out from the top of your deck and into the middle, so can't rely on the simple \"Next time I draw a card, NINJAS!\" heuristic.\n",
